{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nList of worktrees.\n\n## Spec\n- Columns: path (relative to the main worktree where possible), branch (or detached HEAD short hash), flags (`locked`, `prunable`, `bare`)\n- The worktree vig is running in is highlighted\n- Selection shows the HEAD commit summary in the preview pane; `/` search over path / branch\n\nPart of #103.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:56Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":105,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Worktrees: worktrees pane"}
